 summary:["RPA: &lt; 5 ปี, torticollis/neck extension จำกัด, drooling, muffled voice","Peritonsillar abscess: วัยรุ่น, trismus, hot potato voice, uvula deviation","Epiglottitis: thumb sign, tripod — ห้ามตรวจคอ"],
